 (AFRO/WHO/RBM &#x00023;AF/ICP/CPC/400/XA/00), Ministry of Health of the Government of Kenya (DFID agreement number &#x00023;AF/06/416254), and The Kenyan Medical Research Institute. The funders did not have a role in study design, data collection and analysis, decision to publish, or preparation of manuscript.</p></fn><fn id="n102" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests:</bold> The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>